WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:07.471
After going on to the recommended features, the progress bar leads back to the agents, and both later steps stay a click away.

00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:18.302
Unpicking every agent leaves none configured. Continue is disabled, and now the later steps in the bar are disabled too, so the first project cannot be reached without an agent.

00:00:19.254 --> 00:00:26.894
Picking Claude Code again opens the way on. Each Ready badge now also needs git to be set up, so it always agrees with the callout.
